'''Magby''' (Japanese: '''ブビィ''' ''Buby'') is a {{ct|Fire}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Wisdom of Sea and Sky}} expansion.

